# Force LF on checkout regardless of platform (Windows would otherwise
# apply CRLF to text files). The CI anchor gate (bench/check_anchors.py)
# requires byte-identical inputs on ubuntu/macos/windows, and cinterp.c's
# md5 is embedded in the JIT module name, so source bytes must not depend
# on the OS that checked the repo out.
* text=auto eol=lf
